Subject: ExonRmaPlm patch for affyPLM/preprocessCore version issues available
Message-ID: <nisbCPXiotc.NY-By5dY6bUJ@aroma-affymetrix.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/aroma-affymetrix/c/nisbCPXiotc/m/NY-By5dY6bUJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Hi,

if you're working with exon arrays, a patch for ExonRmaPlm is
available that addresses the recent affyPLM/preprocessCore version
issues.  Just do the following once, and it will be applied whenever
you load the package and until the next version is released:

library(aroma.affymetrix)
downloadPackagePatch("aroma.affymetrix")

Cheers

Henrik

